[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3427.51, "timestamp": "00:57:07", "text": "各位，有件大事。一件大件物品。大件物品。  我們先"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3429.91, "timestamp": "00:57:09", "text": "去拿這些東西，先把那件事辦完，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3437.03, "timestamp": "00:57:17", "text": "把卡放進去。我們會把東西清空，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3439.51, "timestamp": "00:57:19", "text": "然後就可以把它帶回去了。是的。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3442.109, "timestamp": "00:57:22", "text": "。好像有個大件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3444.549, "timestamp": "00:57:24", "text": "物品。不，我們不需要再清空這裡了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3445.51, "timestamp": "00:57:25", "text": "我們會回來的。不用擔心。不用擔心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3448.47, "timestamp": "00:57:28", "text": "你失職了。哦，那是什麼鬼東西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3449.99, "timestamp": "00:57:29", "text": "？是的，那是其中一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3455.829, "timestamp": "00:57:35", "text": "球。哦，你摔倒了。當心。哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3458.71, "timestamp": "00:57:38", "text": "萬物皆脆弱。好的。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3461.91, "timestamp": "00:57:41", "text": "那多少錢？ 9K。好的。呃，放……別放。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3463.75, "timestamp": "00:57:43", "text": "不要放。那可是一件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3465.75, "timestamp": "00:57:45", "text": "大事。是的。就從這裡開始。不，不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3467.589, "timestamp": "00:57:47", "text": "我們先這樣寫。我們就把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3469.67, "timestamp": "00:57:49", "text": "它放在這邊的角落。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3471.829, "timestamp": "00:57:51", "text": "可以隨意表達。我決定把這個收回去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3473.789, "timestamp": "00:57:53", "text": "。那輛車價值"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3477.829, "timestamp": "00:57:57", "text": "1萬美元。是的。不，不。嗯，是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3479.67, "timestamp": "00:57:59", "text": "我們會把這些小件物品拿過來，"}]